===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|shittlecock}} {{i|obsolete}}

===Etymology===
From {{m|en|shuttle}} (from the back-and-forth sense of the word originating with loom weaving) + {{m|en|cock}} (from resemblance to a male bird's plume of tail feathers).

===Pronunciation===
[[File:Volant badminton.jpg|thumb|A shuttlecock.]]
